              understanding the structure, activities, and financial health of your family.
            </p>
            <ul class="small">
              <li>Monitor family members and roles</li>
              <li>Review meeting history and participation</li>
              <li>Observe financial records and package status</li>
              <li>Study reports to prepare for future leadership</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-2">
              <strong>Note:</strong> Management actions remain under the Family Admin. 
              Your access is focused on transparency and leadership preparation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

